      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# Residential Building Assistant\nSingapore, one EC2 host.\n\nCounts use Sum; response time uses Average in milliseconds. CPU uses basic 5-minute EC2 metrics. Other plots use 1-minute periods. No response-time sample is emitted in idle intervals.\n\nDatabase connections include the monitoring probe. The heartbeat helps distinguish an idle app from a stopped metric exporter.\n\nInitial proposed alarm thresholds: CPU >85% for 10 min, disk >85%, memory >90%, any failed instance status check, application errors, and response time >10000 ms. Review after collecting a representative workload. Alarms are not created by this dashboard."
